frac{1}{n^2} - \\frac{1}{n^3} \\right) = (p - 1) - (q - 1) = p - q\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Final Answer\n\n$$\n\\boxed{p - q}\n$$", "close_id": 151668, "open_id": 151667, "eos_id": 151645, "cue_ids": [271, 40, 686, 2936, 13295, 323, 2968, 279, 1590, 4226, 1431, 624, 151668, 271]}